2026-07-27T07:15:30.2188011Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2230098Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2230539Z i /tmp/RtmpORvKCM/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2230834Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2231165Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2231714Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2232172Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2232812Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2233590Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2429533Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2525355Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2850852Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:15:30.2957470Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
